{
  "id": "218001",
  "resourceId": 180,
  "name": "吉蘿婷",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c180_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c180_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "呵呵……注意！愚蠢的傢伙。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "我是吉蘿婷・梅菲斯特，是「平衡的守護者」。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "你能否承受得住？在我體內蠕動的「那個東西」？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "你是我的從者，你必須服從我。\n而我，無論發生任何事，\n都會保護你。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "呼……以前的我被困在名為「孤獨」的結界中。\n可是和你在一起，讓我擺脫了束縛！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "一看到你，我的心就變得火熱……\n這樣下去，我會獲得「火焰心」嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "片翼魔王啊，希望你鎮定。\n不能在此釋放我們的力量。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "就連片翼魔王，都在你面前平靜了下來。\n他似乎對你很滿意。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "平凡的人類是無法理解我的，\n所以我總是那麼孤獨。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "那些傢伙……行為很可疑。\n不會是「組織」的人吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "要避開「組織」的人，沒有比教堂更好的場所了。因為那些傢伙絕對不會涉足那種地方。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "好奇嗎？這隻右眼裡，到底封印著什麼呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "嘿嘿嘿，感覺有無窮無盡的力量。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "等下……一隻眼睛怎麼突然有點刺痛呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "哎，這樣一來「組織」就會更提防我了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "等等，這不會是……\n我找了好久的「那個東西」吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "送兩件禮物就想收買我嗎……咳，真聰明。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "呵呵呵……感謝的話，我就略過了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "也許在我孤獨的生命裡，你是唯一能夠理解我的人。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "我感覺身體內部的混沌被淨化了。\n難道你會使用白魔法嗎？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "在你面前，我將毫無掩飾地展現一切。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "我願意助你一臂之力。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "找我什麼事？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "確實，那邊正刮來一陣不祥的風。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "開啟戰鬥。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "喀喀，是時候釋放我內心的瘋狂了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "……又要掀起一場腥風血雨了啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "想看氣焰囂張的我嗎？哈哈！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "需要裝彈。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "等一下吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "看準時機吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "是時候了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "來吧，片翼魔王！！魔．界．黑．龍．波！！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "終極合體攻擊，接招！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "也不過如此嘛。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈哈……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "可笑的東西！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "呃！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "哼！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "咳呃！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "呵……看來還不是時候。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "哎，又贏了。其實本來不想引起「組織」的注意的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}